Package: lumen
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gautham Palaniappan <gauthampalaniappan@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.7), python3-pil
Recommends: udisks2
Suggests: gphoto2, darktable, gimp
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/gauthampalaniappan/lumen
Description: Browse, rate, tag and lightly edit local photo folders
 Lumen is a small photo organizer. Point it at folders you already have,
 browse a thumbnail grid, rate, tag and album your pictures, make light
 non-destructive edits, and build simple photobooks without ever rewriting
 your originals.
 .
 Needs libadwaita 1.7 or newer (Debian 13, Ubuntu 25.04 or later).
